 "text": "Claude Code runs my marketing agency now. Here are the five connections that made it possible.\n\nSave this if you run a business and still do everything by hand.\n\nOne. GoHighLevel, my CRM. Claude reads the pipeline, moves the deals, and schedules my social posts without me opening the app.\n\nTwo. Google Workspace. Drive, Gmail, and Calendar. It finds the client file, drafts the reply, and books the call.\n\nThree. WordPress. It edits pages, fixes SEO titles, and publishes blog posts straight to the live site.\n\nFour. Meta Ads. Every morning it pulls the spend and the cost per lead, and tells me what to pause.\n\nFive. ElevenLabs. It voices every video I post, including this one.\n\nThey're called MCP servers. You connect each one once, and from then on, Claude Code uses them like an employee who never sleeps.\n\nComment MCP and I'll send you the list with the exact setup for each one. And follow, I post what I build.",
